@startuml seq_search
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #F5FFF5
  BorderColor #2E8B57
}

actor "Пользователь" as User
participant "React SPA" as SPA
participant "FastAPI\n(REST API)" as API
participant "SearchService" as Search
participant "PostgreSQL" as DB

User -> SPA : вводит запрос и нажимает «Найти»
activate SPA

SPA -> API : GET /listings?q=nike&brand=Nike&size=42&city=Москва
activate API

API -> Search : search(query, filters)
activate Search

Search -> DB : SELECT ... WHERE tsv @@ query\nAND brand = ? AND size = ? AND city = ?
activate DB
DB --> Search : List[Listing]
deactivate DB

Search --> API : SearchResult {items, total}
deactivate Search

API --> SPA : 200 OK {items: [...], total: N}
deactivate API

SPA --> User : отображает карточки объявлений
deactivate SPA

opt пользователь аутентифицирован
  User -> SPA : нажимает «В избранное»
  SPA -> API : POST /favorites/{listing_id}
  API --> SPA : 201 Created
  SPA --> User : иконка избранного активна
end
@enduml